msgid "You should explicitly select one to install."
msgstr "Anda patut pilih satu secara bersirat untuk dipasang."

#: apt-private/private-cacheset.cc:298
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Package %s is not available, but is referred to by another package.\n"
"This may mean that the package is missing, has been obsoleted, or\n"
"is only available from another source\n"
msgstr ""
"Pakej %s tidak tersedia, tetapi ianya dirujuk oleh pakej lain.\n"
"Ini bermakna pakej tersebut telah hilang, telah lama, atau\n"
"hanya tersedia dari sumber lain\n"

#: apt-private/private-cacheset.cc:314
msgid "However the following packages replace it:"
msgstr "Walaubagaimanapun pakej berikut menggantikannya:"

#: apt-private/private-cacheset.cc:386
#, c-format
msgid "Package '%s' has no installation candidate"
msgstr "Pakej '%s' tidak mempunyai calon pemasangan"

#: apt-private/private-cacheset.cc:399
#, c-format
msgid "Virtual packages like '%s' can't be removed\n"
msgstr "Pakej maya seperti '%s' tidak boleh dibuang\n"

#. TRANSLATORS: Note, this is not an interactive question
#: apt-private/private-cacheset.cc:411 apt-private/private-install.cc:1138
#, c-format
msgid "Package '%s' is not installed, so not removed. Did you mean '%s'?\n"
msgstr ""
"Pakej '%s' tidak dipasang, jadi tidak dibuang. Anda maksudkan '%s'?\n"

#: apt-private/private-cacheset.cc:417 apt-private/private-install.cc:1144
#, c-format
msgid "Package '%s' is not installed, so not removed\n"
msgstr "Pakej '%s' tidak dipasang, jadi tidak dibuang\n"

#: apt-private/private-cacheset.cc:488
#, c-format
msgid "Note, selecting '%s' instead of '%s'\n"
msgstr "Perhatian, pemilihan '%s' berbanding '%s'\n"

#: apt-private/private-cmndline.cc:423
msgid "Most used commands:"
msgstr "Perintah terbanyak digunakan:"

#: apt-private/private-cmndline.cc:463
#, c-format
msgid "See %s for more information about the available commands."
msgstr "Lihat %s untuk maklumat lanjut berkenaan perintah yang tersedia."

#: apt-private/private-cmndline.cc:467
msgid ""
"Configuration options and syntax is detailed in apt.conf(5).\n"
"Information about how to configure sources can be found in sources.list(5).\n"
"Package and version choices can be expressed via apt_preferences(5).\n"
"Security details are available in apt-secure(8).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pilihan dan sintaks konfigurasi secara terperinci dalam apt.conf(5).\n"
"Maklumat bagaimana hendak konfigurkan sumber yang boleh ditemui dalam\n"
"sources.list(5). Pilihan pakej dan versi boleh diungkap melalui\n"
"apt_preferences(5). Perincian keselamatan juga tersedia di dalam apt-"
"secure(8).\n"

#: apt-private/private-cmndline.cc:472
msgid "This APT has Super Cow Powers."
msgstr "APT ini mempunyai Kuasa Lembu Super."

#: apt-private/private-cmndline.cc:474
msgid "This APT helper has Super Meep Powers."
msgstr "Pembantu APT ini mempunyai Kuasa Meep Super"

#: apt-private/private-cmndline.cc:572
msgid ""
"--force-yes is deprecated, use one of the options starting with --allow "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"--force-yes telah lapuk, guna salah satu dari pilihan yang bermula dengan --"
"allow sebagai ganti."

#: apt-private/private-depends.cc:35 apt-private/private-download.cc:255
