#: cmdline/apt-mark.cc:432
msgid ""
"Usage: apt-mark [options] {auto|manual} pkg1 [pkg2 ...]\n"
"\n"
"apt-mark is a simple command line interface for marking packages\n"
"as manually or automatically installed. It can also be used to\n"
"manipulate the dpkg(1) selection states of packages, and to list\n"
"all packages with or without a certain marking.\n"
msgstr ""
"Penggunaan: apt-mark [options] {auto|manual} pkg1 [pkg2 ...]\n"
"\n"
"apt-mark ialah antaramuka baris perintah ringkas untuk menanda \n"
"pakej sebagai dipasang secara manual atau automatik. Ia juga boleh\n"
"digunakan untuk memanipulasi keadaan pemilihan dpkg(1) bagi\n"
"pakej, dan untuk senaraikan semua pakej dengan atau tanpa\n"
"penandaan tertentu.\n"

#: cmdline/apt-mark.cc:444
msgid "Mark the given packages as automatically installed"
msgstr "Tandakan pakej yang diberi sebagai dipasang secara automatik"

#: cmdline/apt-mark.cc:445
msgid "Mark the given packages as manually installed"
msgstr "Tandakan pakej yang diberi sebagai dipasang secara manual"

#: cmdline/apt-mark.cc:446
msgid "Mark all dependencies of meta packages as automatically installed."
msgstr ""

#: cmdline/apt-mark.cc:447
msgid "Mark a package as held back"
msgstr "Tandakan pakej yang diberi sebagai ditahan"

#: cmdline/apt-mark.cc:448
msgid "Unset a package set as held back"
msgstr "Nyahtetap set pakej sebagai ditahan"

#: cmdline/apt-mark.cc:453
msgid "Print the list of automatically installed packages"
msgstr "Cetak senarai pakej terpasang secara automatik"

#: cmdline/apt-mark.cc:454
msgid "Print the list of manually installed packages"
msgstr "Cetak senarai pakej terpasang secara manual"

#: cmdline/apt-mark.cc:455
msgid "Print the list of packages on hold"
msgstr ""

#: cmdline/apt.cc:46
msgid ""
"Usage: apt [options] command\n"
"\n"
"apt is a commandline package manager and provides commands for\n"
"searching and managing as well as querying information about packages.\n"
"It provides the same functionality as the specialized APT tools,\n"
"like apt-get and apt-cache, but enables options more suitable for\n"
"interactive use by default.\n"
msgstr ""
"Penggunaan: apt [options] command\n"
"\n"
"apt ialah pengurus pakej baris perintah yang menyediakan perintah\n"
"untuk menggelintar dan mengurus serta menanya maklumat berkenaan\n"
"pakej. Ia menyediakan kefungsian yang sama seperti alatan APT khusus,\n"
"It provides the same functionality as the specialized APT tools,\n"
"seperti apt-get dan apt-cache, tetapi membenarkan lagi pilihan yang\n"
"sesuai untuk penggunaan interaktif secara lalai.\n"

